WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.995 --> 00:00:01.828
- This is so weird!

00:00:01.828 --> 00:00:03.790
- Wow, it's so weird, the interviewer

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.410
becomes the interviewee.
- I know.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:06.310
The tables have turned.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.540
- The tables have turned.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.330
- Do you remember anything
from our day-drinking day?

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.710
- Well, I remember being
drunk enough that I thought

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.098
I was hittin' all those notes.

00:00:14.098 --> 00:00:14.960
(audience laughs)

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.980
- (laughs) You were almost there!

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.407
- [Seth] I was almost there.

00:00:17.407 --> 00:00:18.240
- That's like awesome.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.073
- I feel like it's a lot,

00:00:19.073 --> 00:00:19.920
I think I coulda done it,

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.490
if you weren't lookin' right at me.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.530
- Okay, I was, and I was laughing,

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.230
but I was drunk.
- Yeah.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.000
I remember that after you
left, I went to my producer,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.267
and I said, "I feel terrible

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.230
"I forgot to say goodbye to Kelly."

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.600
and he said, "You have
said goodbye to her twice."

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.587
(audience laughs)
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.587 --> 00:00:38.357
"And each time you said
the exact same thing,

00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:40.369
"as if the first time hadn't happened."

00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:41.220
(audience laughs)

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.470
- I think we both did that though,

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:43.730
'cause I said that to my people.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.107
I was like, "I was
nice, I was respectable.

00:00:45.107 --> 00:00:46.340
"I said bye, right?"

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:50.295
And my husband was like,
"Just, let's just go."

00:00:50.295 --> 00:00:51.420
- [Seth] Yeah.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.200
- Like it was, I have never,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.690
I've never been drinking in the day.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.523
- Yeah.

00:00:55.523 --> 00:00:56.820
- You are my only time I've ever drank,

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.510
even now, I don't drink during the day,

00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.410
'cause I'm usually working.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.309
- Yeah, most people work during the day.

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:02.370
(audience laughs)

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.760
Don't judge yourself too harshly.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.593
- [Kelly] No.

00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:05.430
- At least your husband was there

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:06.430
so he could see what happens.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.930
What happens with me is I've never not

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.780
gotten into a minor fight with
my wife after day-drinking,

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.140
because she's at home with the two kids,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.320
and then I come home, again, at 2:30,

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.860
and I like walk in all drunk,

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.550
and I knock a lamp over.
- And you've gotta speak.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.010
- And she'll be like,
"What's wrong with you?"

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.871
and I'm like, "It was for work!"

00:01:22.871 --> 00:01:24.347
(audience laughs)
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:25.217
"I was working!"

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.437
- You're welcome!
- "You're welcome!

00:01:28.437 --> 00:01:31.475
"This drinking puts clothes on our kids!"

00:01:31.475 --> 00:01:33.210
(audience laughs)
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:35.460
- No one has a problem, it's fine.

